<%#
# Usage of a clinic

The limits of the clinic with what is used (see SuperAdmin::AccountUsage):
meters, «Не ограничено» instead of a huge number, sizes in ГБ/МБ.

## Local variables:

- `field`: an `AccountUsageField`.
%>
<% rows = field.rows %>

<% if rows.present? %>
  <div class="admin-usage-grid">
    <% rows.each do |row| %>
      <%= render 'super_admin/accounts/usage_row', row: row %>
    <% end %>
  </div>
<% else %>
  <p class="m-0 text-xs italic text-n-slate-10"><%= t('super_admin.limits.no_usage') %></p>
<% end %>
